                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset contains information about the paving expenses made by Ghent's city government during the 14th century (1321-1389). Each line corresponds to one mention of paving location in the city account. Two columns correpond to the GIS identifer of the location.</p>"
